<title>USA: Assocs First Capital to issue debt-dealers.</title>
<headline>Assocs First Capital to issue debt-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associates First Capital Inc is expected to issue $500 million in five-year debt via a competitive bid offering on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Associates First Capital is a major diversified consumer and commercial finance company.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
</text>
